The '''Egg''' and the '''Brown Egg''' are [[:Category:Animal Products|animal products]]  obtained from White, Brown, or Blue [[Chicken]]s. [[Marnie]] may also gift you 12 eggs at the [[Feast of the Winter Star]]. [[Shane]] sells Eggs in his [[Desert Festival#Villager Shops|shop]] at the [[Desert Festival]] for {{Price|1|Calico}} [[Calico Egg]].

Eggs can be hatched in an [[incubator]], which comes with a Big or Deluxe [[Coop]].

